# Wave W17-K (Gloom Cave): gloom wall — near-black torch-warmed bands of the gut wall, the warm band at torch height flecked amber where the caver’s light keeps catching it, the courses below sunk to the deepest black-brown in the fleet (design: black torch-lit cave walls). The Gloom’s own wall — split from Junction’s banded warm grey by value, and from the Crown Road’s ashlar by register: rough gut bands, no laid courses.
